    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d440">

                <pb facs="0552" n="458" xml:id="pg458"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.20/319: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Chargé in Liberia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Carter</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-02-28T18:00:00-05:00">February 28, 1930—6
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>23. Your 22, February 13, last sentence. War Department will authorize Outley’s
                    reinstatement in former grade on re-enlistment. Law does not permit time he has
                    spent in Liberia to count for seniority.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Carr</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
